WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,610 --> 00:00:04,510
Chief Wen

2
00:00:09,540 --> 00:00:10,540
Chief Wen

3
00:00:11,320 --> 00:00:12,800
How much identity does he have?

4
00:00:13,200 --> 00:00:18,010
Why did he come to Zhongzhou, Chief Wen?

5
00:00:18,450 --> 00:00:19,490
Should come to perform tasks

6
00:00:20,390 --> 00:00:21,670
So enviable

7
00:00:21,870 --> 00:00:22,870
No need to clock in

8
00:00:22,870 --> 00:00:23,990
Run as you please for five weeks

9
00:00:24,310 --> 00:00:28,110
You can still travel at public expense. Don’t talk nonsense about this distance.

10
00:00:28,110 --> 00:00:29,310
Chief Wen must be able to hear it.

11
00:00:29,950 --> 00:00:34,810
I just think it’s unfair. Do you know how much money Xizhou Mission gave him? Two billion

12
00:00:38,100 --> 00:00:39,260
They are all special bureau employees

13
00:00:39,740 --> 00:00:41,220
Why do executors get higher wages?

14
00:00:41,220 --> 00:00:44,040
Wen Chen doesn’t have to sit on duty for one mission

15
00:00:44,040 --> 00:00:45,160
Take two billion

16
00:00:45,160 --> 00:00:48,580
I will never be able to make money from the hospital bureau in my life

17
00:00:48,580 --> 00:00:49,780
The original plan was only 50 million

18
00:00:50,340 --> 00:00:51,660
Spend your life to save people

19
00:00:52,940 --> 00:00:54,180
This number still needs to be debated
